# 📖 Complete OWASP Top 10 (2021) Revision

| Category                                 | Key Defense                                        |
| ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| Broken Access Control                    | Server-side authorization checks, RBAC             |
| Cryptographic Failures                   | Strong encryption, HTTPS, secure key management    |
| Injection                                | Parameterized queries, input validation            |
| Insecure Design                          | Threat modeling, secure architecture               |
| Security Misconfiguration                | Secure defaults, patching, hardening               |
| Vulnerable Components                    | Dependency management, updates                     |
| Identification & Authentication Failures | MFA, secure sessions, strong passwords             |
| Software & Data Integrity Failures       | Trusted dependencies, signature verification       |
| Security Logging & Monitoring Failures   | Centralized logging, SIEM, alerting                |
| SSRF                                     | Input validation, network restrictions, allowlists |

